        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of autoantibodies against the insulin receptor plus severe insulin resistance with hyperglycemia refractory to insulin therapy",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is supported by exclusion of other causes of insulin resistance and detection of insulin receptor autoantibodies."
